From 826803ba87e5adf7ad10117b45b3b4609e854dce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:37:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1700/3799] soh: rename func_8005B198 ->
 Camera_GetTargetCategory

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: returns the actor category the camera last locked onto; Bg_Bdan_Switch compares it against its own category to tell whether the camera is watching it.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_camera.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
